#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:6
msgid "YAML Description Reference"
msgstr "YAML 描述参考"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:8
msgid ""
"!!! note \"Document Status: PLANNED — Automatic generation system under "
"development\""
msgstr ""
"!!! note \"文档状态：PLANNED — 自动生成系统正在开发中\""

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:10
msgid ""
"The YAML Reference will be automatically extracted from YAML files in "
"directories such as `core/*/properties/`, `core/*/registers/`, "
"`soc/*/pinmux/`, providing a complete reference for device properties, "
"register definitions, and pin multiplexing configurations."
msgstr ""
"YAML 参考将从 `core/*/properties/`、`core/*/registers/`、`soc/*/pinmux/` 等目录中的 YAML 文件中自动提取，提供设备属性、寄存器定义和引脚复用配置的完整参考。"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:12
msgid "Planned Content"
msgstr "计划内容"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:14
msgid "Device Properties"
msgstr "设备属性"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:15
msgid ""
"Configuration properties and capability descriptions for each peripheral "
"(`core/*/properties/*.yaml`)"
msgstr ""
"每个外设的配置属性和能力描述（`core/*/properties/*.yaml`）"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:17
msgid "Register Definitions"
msgstr "寄存器定义"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:18
msgid ""
"Register layout and bit field descriptions for each peripheral "
"(`core/*/registers/*.yaml`)"
msgstr ""
"每个外设的寄存器布局和位域描述（`core/*/registers/*.yaml`）"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:20
msgid "Pin Multiplexing (Pinmux)"
msgstr "引脚复用（Pinmux）"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:21
msgid "Pin function assignments for each chip package (`soc/*/pinmux/*.yaml`)"
msgstr "每个芯片封装的引脚功能分配（`soc/*/pinmux/*.yaml`）"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:23
msgid "Implementation Plan"
msgstr "实现计划"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:25
msgid ""
"Based on extending the existing `yaml_reader.py`, `properties_gen.py`, "
"and `registers_gen.py`, structured reference documentation will be "
"automatically generated."
msgstr ""
"基于扩展现有的 `yaml_reader.py`、`properties_gen.py` 和 `registers_gen.py`，将自动生成结构化的参考文档。"

#: ../../source/yaml_reference/index.md:27
msgid "The automatic generation system will be added later."
msgstr "自动生成系统将在后续添加。"
